## Statuses

NOT_STARTED · INVENTORIED · SPECIFIED · KERNEL_GAP · IMPLEMENTING · FUNCTIONAL_PARITY · VISUAL_PARITY · VERIFIED · BLOCKED · INTENTIONAL_DIFFERENCE

**Only VERIFIED counts as migrated.** FUNCTIONAL_PARITY without evidence is not done.

## Score

`verified / (total - intentional_difference)` for release. Blocked > 0 blocks a “complete” claim.

## Release gates (full migration)

Copied from master prompt §21. Counts in `migration/FINAL-REPORT.md`. Table:

`Category | Total | Verified | Intentional Difference | Blocked`

## Slice gate

`07-first-slice.sdd` + `FIRST-DELIVERABLE.md` §10. Rows `TOKENS`, `THEME` (minimal), `W0-BUTTON`.

## Pro / visx / registry blocks

- `PRO` default INTENTIONAL_DIFFERENCE pending product decision (ADR 0005/0006).
- visx subpath: separate rows; not silent drop.
- Registry blocks: compose wave, not Wave 0.
